# src/apps/android/app/src/test/java/com/luminet/android/dns

## Purpose
Provides host-side unit coverage for Android DNS integration and configuration behavior.

## Contents
Contains JVM tests and fixtures for DNS models, validation, selection, or lifecycle helpers in the Android application.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Exercises production DNS contracts using deterministic local inputs and mocks rather than requiring live Android networking.

## Invariants
Tests must not depend on external DNS availability, must cover invalid/edge inputs where relevant, and must leave shared test state clean between cases.